<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's Victoria to privatise public transport.</title>
<headline>Australia's Victoria to privatise public transport.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's Victoria state announced on Thursday it planned to privatise its public transport system by the end of calendar 1998.  </p>
<p>A government spokesman told Reuters the privatisation would involve only the management of the state's public train, bus and tram services.</p>
<p>The assets would remain publicly-owned, he said.</p>
<p>&quot;The whole thing will be franchised out to private ownership,&quot; the spokesman said.</p>
</text>
